# Demo of movie mode (Milestone 19a). Press F8 on any map; Start skips.
# The real intro movie (19b) gets its own generated artwork.

fade out 0.6
movie start
music stop 0.6
image forest res://assets/ui/battle_bg_forest.png at 0,20
fade in 1.2
pan forest to 0,-8 over 7 async
title Divine Light
wait 2
title clear
caption Long ago, the land of Valdris knew only light.
wait 2.5
caption Then came the Unraveling.
wait 2.5
caption clear
sync
fade out 1.0
movie end
music overworld
fade in 0.6
